  "description": "Chaos-game rendering of a 3D Sierpinski tetrahedron. Splat size follows perspective, and the last two vertex picks name the sub-tetrahedron so the self-similar nesting shows as coloured sub-copies, over attractor-biased chaos, corner flares and temporal accumulation. Mouse rotates the view.",
